anguozhi-053-xuezong","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line039-pei01-01","quote":"吳錄曰：其先齊孟嘗君封於薛。秦滅六國，而失其祀，子孫分散。漢祖定天下，過齊，求孟嘗後，得其孫陵、國二人，欲復其封。陵、國兄弟相推，莫適受，乃去之竹邑，因家焉，故遂氏薛。自國至綜，世典州郡，為著姓。綜少明經，善屬文，有秀才。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line039-pei01-01:m0048","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line039-pei01-01:m0046"}],"interpretation_note":"以此來源所述兩端為據。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line039-pei01-01:m0046","surface":"陵","start":46,"end":47,"kind":"person","person_id":"6ag_tjs_kd5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段具名及前後親稱、官職定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line039-pei01-01","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line039-pei01-01:m0057","surface":"陵","start":57,"end":58,"kind":"person","person_id":"6ag_tjs_kd5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本段具名及前後親稱、官職定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line039-pei01-01","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-wu053-xuezong-0","subject_person_id":"kns_cua_jec","object_person_id":"6ag_tjs_kd5","predicate":"brother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"陵、國兄弟相推"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-053","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-053-xuezong","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line039-pei01-01","quote":"吳錄曰：其先齊孟嘗君封於薛。秦滅六國，而失其祀，子孫分散。漢祖定天下，過齊，求孟嘗後，得其孫陵、國二人，欲復其封。陵、國兄弟相推，莫適受，乃去之竹邑，因家焉，故遂氏薛。自國至綜，世典州郡，為著姓。綜少明經，善屬文，有秀才。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line039-pei01-01:m0048","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line039-pei01-01:m0046"}],"interpretation_note":"以此來源所述兩端為據。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":